<title>JAPAN: Japan Apr-Sept kerosene imports soar yr/yr -- MITI.</title>
<headline>Japan Apr-Sept kerosene imports soar yr/yr -- MITI.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan's imports of kerosene during the six months from April to September soared 120.4 percent compared to the same period a year earlier to 877,000 kilolitres (kl), the Trade Ministry said on Friday.</p>
<p>In the six-month period, sales of kerosene, used for heating amounted to 8.43 million kl, a rise of 10.4 percent compared to a year earlier, the Ministry said.</p>
<p>Details of oil product imports were as follows:</p>
<p>	 (In 1,000 kl) (1,000 bbl) yr/yr%</p>
<p> Gasoline	908	5,711    - 19.9</p>
<p> Naphtha    14,913     93,803    +  6.4</p>
<p> Kerosene	887	5,579    +120.4</p>
<p> Gas oil     1,055	6,636    +  7.5</p>
<p> Fuel oil A    618	3,887    + 48.6</p>
<p> Fuel oil C  1,602     10,077    + 54.2</p>
</text>
